"turn_index":10},{"dia_id":"D22:5","global_turn_index":374,"locator":"[S22T5]","raw_turn_sha256":"d9df745e960a9235c8ef6144815906d4e022abaaa2b260446481c487ba842026","rendered_turn_sha256":"1a4bb4e5e3813ac263f857847d17b16c435017bddad1d4cd221ef7b81c61324e","session_date":"2023-10-08","session_datetime":"2023-10-08T15:13:00","session_id":"session_22","session_index":22,"source_sha256":"21025906b21bb4f66753338fae54c39b0c8d7507b31852bdc3645a6571e8e0b0","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":5},{"dia_id":"D22:6","global_turn_index":375,"locator":"[S22T6]","raw_turn_sha256":"5fcce4f279a78847ead4beea8ee2b9ff8636070d0293d7904000b82401258be3","rendered_turn_sha256":"cdb97b02ead7ab0929e49b06a34327709bdc5d6775decbee5bf8f2e7667813d2","session_date":"2023-10-08","session_datetime":"2023-10-08T15:13:00","session_id":"session_22","session_index":22,"source_sha256":"3782a0284566f921eb52bb03cbb538fbe5833070ef3586e44fade39c05487947","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":6},{"dia_id":"D22:7","global_turn_index":376,"locator":"[S22T7]","raw_turn_sha256":"97481435a1f1b8d343869cecac8aaeb00e4e0e975b054f2f3c028b193c5ded65","rendered_turn_sha256":"1f9c962e02107c042c4f8369c564114c82ba95ea02278b9eb7a5ffa9715fd304","session_date":"2023-10-08","session_datetime":"2023-10-08T15:13:00","session_id":"session_22","session_index":22,"source_sha256":"ed75d8320d1810b91785f6741a2569dce13bf4b713e834e9504a2868e8d44d53","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":7}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- Passionate about fixing up things in general: \"more than just a hobby\" — it gives him a sense of achievement and purpose [S7T6].\n- Gets \"a real buzz\" transforming something that's not working into something that runs smoothly — \"like giving it a second chance\" [S7T6].\n- Giving something a new life \"makes [him] feel powerful and happy — like [he] really achieved something\"; he agreed with Calvin that they both \"take something and make it look amazing\" [S7T7][S7T8].\n- On 2023-08-03, said fixing cars is like therapy for him; growing up he worked on cars with his dad, and refurbishing them gives him a sense of fulfillment [S12T2].\n- On 2023-09-02, when telling Calvin he's been tied up with car stuff, said fixing stuff up and seeing it turn out better is \"really rewarding and gives me a sense of purpose\", and that fixing someone's car makes him feel like he's \"making a difference\"; he's made \"proud\" to see the relief on someone's face when their car is fixed (echoing his long-stated sense of purpose from fixing things, see above) [S17T3][S17T5].\n- Has fond memories of working on cars with his dad as a kid: they spent one summer restoring an old car — \"It was hard work, but seeing the end result and knowing that we did it together was really satisfying\" [S12T4].\n- Shared a photo from that time: a man and a child (Dave and his dad) posing for a picture — \"a wonderful experience\" [S12T6].\n- On 2023-09-15, told Calvin (answering whether it's satisfying to see his hard work pay off, on the restoration finished that day — context in ## Car mod workshop (2023-08-11)) that \"It's so satisfying to see this brought back to life,\" especially seeing people's reactions when they see the finished product — \"makes all the hard work worth it\" [S19T9].\n- On 2023-10-04, said he loves being able to transform something old and beat-up into something beautiful, and that it's the small successes that make him feel proud and fulfilled (said to Calvin right after Calvin praised his grease-stained hands — \"Those hands show you worked hard. You put in lots of effort. You should definitely be proud!\" — context in ## Car mod workshop (2023-08-11)) [S21T10].\n- On 2023-10-08, when telling Calvin about his car show and restored/modified car (details in ## Classic cars), said working on cars \"is not just a hobby, it's a passion\" — it's \"like therapy, a way to get away from everyday stress\"; as a kid he'd spend hours in his dad's garage, tinkering with engines — \"it was like my own sanctuary\" (echoing his childhood memories of working on cars with his dad, see above); now he's \"lucky enough to do this as a job, to take something broken and make it into something awesome\" [S22T5].\n- On 2023-10-08, said doing what he loves has been \"my goal since I was a kid\" and it's awesome that he's able to do it; restoring things can be tough but \"the feeling of accomplishment it gives is great\"; Calvin responded that bringing broken things back to life is \"so satisfying,\" that working on cars \"can be a real escape from reality\" (he understands the feeling), and that \"doing what you love for a living, that's the ultimate goal,\" adding \"Keep going with it, it's really inspiring.\" [S22T5][S22T6][S22T7].","text_sha256":"498869aec8ac2f3647537e74c9b8f593b66f08542406b2c1ab5953f04c5e45f8","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":4268,"filesystem_tool_calls":5,"model_calls":8,"orchestration_calls":10,"prompt_tokens":455386,"provider_request_attempts":8,"provider_rounds":7,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":459654},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"56a7ee328b702acf677218605c2d649afe0089eda09165e5aadb286969116965","filesystem_tools_sha256":"6d9d68f047917d20adb9133168d5726233c9719dbefd54627e08827832d963c6","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3506af86ae75acd7ce07f88bae7a25e1bfec56a5b1c9f44abd3d71a2e6f4eb2d","paper_prompt_id":"filesystem-appendix-a3-prompt-5-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"de03315ff999a8bcea7e08a10866f3a6dc74badf690d23a036e35c74ff81335c"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"What i